          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai kibunata ŋes Yosakar okoku loka Simeat, ka Yekosabad okoku loka Somer, ikekejaanakinak, kotwana; aponi kidaikinai kalukapapaake ore loka Daudi: kirum Amasia okokuke aiboisike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
